#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/chanthason/index.html:0
msgid "“A green tick — I can trust a hospital I’ve never heard of.”"
msgstr "“一个绿色对勾——我可以信任一家从没听说过的医院。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/index.html:0
msgid "“A strange room, but nobody has to guess what he has had.”"
msgstr "“陌生的房间，但没有人需要猜他打过什么疫苗。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "“Absent” is a finding, not a failure — the question is only whether it blocks this use case."
msgstr "“缺失”是一项发现，而不是失败——问题只在于它是否会阻碍这一用例。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "“Absent” is a finding, not a failure. The only question is whether it blocks this use case. Narrow: one population or credential · Shared: build once for many programmes · Borrowed: adopt a regional or international artefact."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/khamla-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“Another trip — but at least they know about his vaccines now.”"
msgstr "“又要跑一趟——不过至少他们现在知道他打过哪些疫苗了。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/anan/index.html:0
msgid "“Born here, vaccinated there — and I can see all of it.”"
msgstr "“在这里出生，在那里接种——而我能看到全部。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/chanthason/index.html:0
msgid "“Different name, same vaccine — I can make that call.”"
msgstr "“名字不同，疫苗相同——这个判断我可以做。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/bounmy-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“Good, he’s on our family record now.”"
msgstr "“很好，他现在在我们的家庭记录里了。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/anan/index.html:0
msgid "“He isn’t Taifafeki, but he still needs a record he can take home.”"
msgstr "“他不是泰法费基人，但他仍然需要一份能带回家的记录。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/vilay/index.html:0
msgid "“I can read it, but I can’t prove it’s real out here.”"
msgstr "“我能读出来，但在这里我证明不了它是真的。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/bounmy-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“I decide who sees it, and for how long.”"
msgstr "“由我决定谁能看到，以及能看多久。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/khamla-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“I hope we’re not in trouble for giving birth abroad.”"
msgstr "“希望我们不会因为在国外生孩子而惹上麻烦。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/khamla-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“It all followed him.”"
msgstr "“一切都跟着他。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/khamla-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“It’s on his phone. What if I travel without him?”"
msgstr "“记录在他的手机上。如果我不跟他一起出行怎么办？”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/bounmy-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“No folder of papers this time.”"
msgstr "“这次不用带一沓纸了。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/vilay/index.html:0
msgid "“No signal for weeks — but I need to register him today.”"
msgstr "“几周都没有信号——但我今天就得给他登记。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/khamla-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“Now I know exactly when to come back.”"
msgstr "“现在我确切知道什么时候该回来了。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/bounmy-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“One phone, three people — I can manage all of us.”"
msgstr "“一部手机，三个人——我能管好我们所有人。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/khamla-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“They believe the Taifafeki papers!”"
msgstr "“他们相信泰法费基的纸质记录！”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/index.html:0
msgid "“Three weeks old, and now he counts.”"
msgstr "“三周大了，现在他才算数。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/index.html:0
msgid "“Two small jabs, and a record that will follow him.”"
msgstr "“两针小小的疫苗，还有一份会跟着他的记录。”"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/khamla-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "“Will anyone back home believe these papers?”"
msgstr "“家乡会有人相信这些纸吗？”"

