msgid "<0>Joint, both tracks:</0> FHIR around the world and the story we follow (Workshop hosts, with the policy track). P1.1 Welcome; P1.2 WHO remarks; P1.3 How the two days work; P1.4 Country panel; P1.5 Walkthrough of the five journeys"
msgstr ""

