msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Policy.</0> Should the part of the record that crosses borders be profiled once for the region, with national extensions left sovereign?"
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Policy.</0> Should the trust network be built once for the region and every programme, not for immunization alone?"
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Policy.</0> What agreement makes every view abroad leave an entry in your home log, and who reads it?"
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Policy.</0> What is your twelve-month first move, who owns it, and which cost dominates it?"
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Policy.</0> What legal basis lets a clinician abroad open a record held at home on the family's consent, and who sets how the link is protected?"
