msgid "<0>Technical.</0> A core data element that tells a reported dose from a verified one."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> AuditEvent logged in Onesa on every access, including failed passcodes."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Birth-dose data elements: vaccine, product code, batch, date, giver (immunization DAK core data dictionary)."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Client registry holds a child with no birth record; referral to the clinic."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Client registry, CRVS link, offline CHW app, facility registry for the catchment."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Clinic EHR as a verifier; trust store loaded from the national trust anchor."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Code map between neighbours' vaccine products."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Connectathon test of issuer, gateway and viewer."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Consent resource recorded; 4-digit passcode; 14-day expiry."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Credential issued to a child with no national ID."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Document signer certificate (DSC) and its key; HCERT/CWT signing of each DVC."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Facility EMR, product registry, immunization registry, trust services."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Family wallet on one shared phone, one profile and one VHL per member."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> GDHCN onboarding and a clinic verifier."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> GDHCN trust list (DID documents), cached for offline verification; kid lookup."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Hospital immunization record; one DVC per birth dose, signed by the document signer of Taifafeki."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> IPS plus an immunization core as the part of the record that crosses borders."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Issuing to the WHO certificate specification."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> National FHIR server behind a gateway; IPS assembled from the lifelong record."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> National portal issues a passcode-protected link to the IPS and DVCs."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Offline CHW app reads the cards without verifying them."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> One trust network for every programme that signs credentials."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Parent holds the child's record on a shared device."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Point-of-care viewer reads the whole first year from Onesa."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Product code mapping and the computable national schedule."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Read-unverified: the CHW device decodes but does not verify."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Regional IPS + immunization profile with national extensions."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Signature checked offline against the cached GDHCN trust list."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Temporary id created at a home visit, offline."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Terminology service: the product code of Taifafeki kept, the schedule code of Onesa added beside it; schedule logic over every dose."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Viewer verifies the VHL's HCERT against the DSC of Onesa from the trust list."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Technical.</0> Whichever moment breaks hardest for the country."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Terminology Service</0>: The Terminology Service is a governed, publicly accessible service that manages, publishes, and provides access to the standardised terminologies, code systems, value sets, and concept maps used across the digital health ecosystem."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j3-made-official/index.html:0
msgid "<0>The card has been tampered with.</0> The signature check fails, the doses stay unverified and the nurse follows the local catch-up policy."
msgstr "<0>卡片已被篡改。</0>签名检查失败，剂次保持未验证，护士遵循当地补种政策。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "<0>The cards are lost on the way home.</0> The doses still happened, but no proof travels. Clinicians in Onesa must re-vaccinate or rely on memory."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/technical-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>The scope promise.</0> Two days, one cross-border immunization story. Day 1 covers the building blocks and gets everyone running on Heropa. Day 2 is teams building one part of the journey, then seeing it all work together."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "<0>The scope promise.</0> You will not leave with an assessment or a plan. You will leave knowing what each consists of, where your country stands on its first page, and who you would do the rest with."
msgstr "<0>范围承诺。</0>您离开时不会带走一份评估或一份计划。您离开时将了解两者各包含哪些内容、贵国在其第一页上处于什么位置，以及您将与谁一起完成其余部分。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-1-full-history-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "<0>The wrong passcode is entered.</0> Access is refused and the attempt is still logged back in Onesa."
msgstr "<0>输入了错误的通行码。</0>访问被拒绝，而该尝试仍会记录回奥内萨。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j3-made-official/index.html:0
msgid "<0>There is no automatic match for the foreign vaccine.</0> That is exactly this step. The nurse decides — and her decision could be shared so the next nurse doesn’t have to."
msgstr "<0>外国疫苗没有自动匹配项。</0>这正是本步骤。由护士作出决定——她的决定可以共享，下一位护士就不必再判断。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Trust anchor</0>: The national authority whose key vouches for the health sector's signers."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Trust list</0>: A published list of keys accepted as valid issuers. The GDHCN shares these between countries."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Verifiable credential (VC)</0>: A digitally signed statement, such as a vaccination record, that anyone can check is genuine and unaltered."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/technical-track/t7/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Viewer app</0> (The clinic abroad): Open a shared health link and read the records behind it. Steps J4.1."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j2-found-at-home/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Vilay’s phone stays offline for 28 days.</0> Everything stays queued safely on the device and syncs when she next reaches the health center."
msgstr "<0>Vilay 的手机连续 28 天离线。</0>所有内容都安全地在设备上排队，并在她下次到达卫生中心时同步。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J2b/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Vilay</0>: Adds <1>Somsak</1> to the Sengmany household, saves the two doses as unverified and books a clinic referral."
msgstr "<0>Vilay</0>：将 <1>Somsak</1> 加入 Sengmany 家庭，把两剂次保存为未验证，并预约诊所转诊。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J2a/index.html:0
msgid "<0>Vilay</0>: Scans both QR cards and reads the doses, without checking their signatures."
msgstr "<0>Vilay</0>：扫描两张 QR 码卡片并读取剂次，但不核查其签名。"

