#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J4.0b/index.html:0
msgid "Is a 4-digit spoken passcode the right balance of security and ease for this family?"
msgstr "对这个家庭而言，口头说出的 4 位通行码是否在安全与便利之间取得了恰当的平衡？"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-0-one-family-one-phone/index.html:0
msgid "Is a family wallet a national service, a private app, or both — and who decides which apps may hold a record?"
msgstr "家庭钱包是国家服务、私营应用，还是两者兼有——由谁决定哪些应用可以保存记录？"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j2-found-at-home/index.html:0
msgid "Is added to his household: the Onesa health system now knows he exists."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J2a/index.html:0
msgid "Is an “unverified but recorded” vaccine useful to the next clinician — or a risk?"
msgstr "一剂“未验证但已记录”的疫苗，对下一位临床医生是有用的信息，还是一种风险？"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "Is born, and gets his Hep B and BCG birth doses within hours."
msgstr "出生，并在几小时内接种乙肝（Hep B）和 BCG 出生剂次。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "iss SHALL be optional and SHALL be encoded as a text string. When present, the issuer SHALL require two upper-case letters, the alpha-2 form used in iss and in the DSC's X.509 C attribute."
msgstr "iss 应为可选项，并应编码为文本字符串。如果存在，签发方应要求其为两个大写字母，即 iss 和 DSC 的 X.509 C 属性中使用的 alpha-2 形式。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "Issuance SHALL be two-phase: prepare returns the exact bytes to sign (the Sig_structure), the caller signs them by any means, including asynchronous ones such as WebCrypto or a remote KMS, and finish assembles the certificate and returns the HC1 string and the COSE bytes. For ES256, finish SHALL accept r||s or DER and SHALL always emit r||s."
msgstr "签发应分两个阶段进行：prepare 返回待签名的确切字节（Sig_structure），调用方以任何方式对其签名，包括 WebCrypto 或远程 KMS 等异步方式，finish 则组装证书并返回 HC1 字符串和 COSE 字节。对于 ES256，finish 应接受 r||s 或 DER，并应始终输出 r||s。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "Issuer · signs: which institution digitally signs credentials for our health sector?"
msgstr ""

