msgid "OHS FHIR Info Gateway — How it works — Journeys"
msgstr "OHS FHIR Info Gateway — 工作原理 — 旅程"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/technical-track/how/ohs-info-gateway/index.html:0
msgid "OHS FHIR Info Gateway — How it works — Verifiable immunization records across borders: the technical track"
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J2b/index.html:0
msgid "OHS FHIR Info Gateway: The authorization (AuthZ) layer in front of the national FHIR server. It checks the caller’s access token from the identity provider, applies access rules (role, facility, household, consent) to every request, and records each access."
msgstr "OHS FHIR Info Gateway：位于国家 FHIR 服务器前端的授权（AuthZ）层。它检查调用方从身份提供方获得的访问令牌，对每个请求应用访问规则（角色、机构、家庭、同意），并记录每次访问。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j2-found-at-home/index.html:0
msgid "OHS FHIR SDK"
msgstr "OHS FHIR SDK"

