msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "On paper"
msgstr "纸质形式"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J1/index.html:0
msgid "On paper: Signed cards in the family's hands."
msgstr "纸质形式：已签名的卡片由家人持有。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j2-found-at-home/index.html:0
msgid "On sync, checks the CHW’s token and only lets her write to households in her own catchment"
msgstr "同步时检查 CHW 的令牌，只允许她写入其自身服务片区内的家庭"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j2-found-at-home/index.html:0
msgid "On the CHW app's newborn form (structured data capture, <0/>) she adds Somsak to the Sengmany household (<1/>), with a temporary id. Bounmy confirms the details as head of household. The app saves the doses read from the cards as reported by the family, not verified (<2/>, <3/>: <4/> false). Vilay refers Somsak to the district health center (<5/>). Everything stays queued on the phone, for 28 days if need be, and syncs when it next reaches a signal."
msgstr "她在 CHW 应用的新生儿表单（结构化数据采集，<0/>）中将 Somsak 加入 Sengmany 家庭（<1/>），并分配一个临时 id。Bounmy 以户主身份确认信息。应用将从卡片读取的剂次保存为由家人报告、未经验证（<2/>、<3/>：<4/> false）。Vilay 将 Somsak 转诊至区卫生中心（<5/>）。所有内容都在手机上排队，必要时可保留 28 天，并在下次有信号时同步。"

