msgstr "访问日志条目（IG）"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j3-made-official/index.html:0
msgid "The API SHALL make the payload and claims reachable only through a successful verification result type. Code that inspects an unverified payload SHALL go through an explicitly named unsafe or diagnostic call."
msgstr "API 应确保载荷和声明只能通过成功的验证结果类型访问。检查未验证载荷的代码应通过一个明确命名的不安全（unsafe）或诊断调用进行。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "The architecture map"
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j2-found-at-home/index.html:0
msgid "The authorization (AuthZ) layer in front of the national FHIR server. It checks the caller’s access token from the identity provider, applies access rules (role, facility, household, consent) to every request, and records each access."
msgstr "位于国家 FHIR 服务器前端的授权（AuthZ）层。它检查调用方从身份提供方获得的访问令牌，对每个请求应用访问规则（角色、机构、家庭、同意），并记录每次访问。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The baby has no Taifafeki ID number, so his records would normally stay locked inside the Taifafeki hospital’s system."
msgstr "婴儿没有泰法费基身份证号，因此他的记录通常会被锁在泰法费基医院的系统里。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "The canvas each table fills in: a cover and Sheets 1 to 6, A3 landscape. Print one set per table, or download the Word file to fill in on screen."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/index.html:0
msgid "The canvas each table fills in: print one set per table, A3 landscape. The page links the editable Word file and a print-ready PDF."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J3a/index.html:0
msgid "The card has been tampered with."
msgstr "卡片已被篡改。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J1/index.html:0
msgid "The cards are lost on the way home."
msgstr "卡片在回家途中丢失。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The caregiver holds two signed paper DVCs"
msgstr "照护者持有两份已签名的纸质 DVC"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j2-found-at-home/index.html:0
msgid "The CBOR decoder SHALL enforce configurable limits on nesting depth, item count and string/byte-string length, and SHALL reject malformed or truncated input with a typed error, without panicking or throwing unchecked exceptions."
msgstr "CBOR 解码器应对嵌套深度、条目数量以及字符串/字节串长度实施可配置的限制，并应以类型化错误拒绝格式错误或被截断的输入，而不发生崩溃（panic）或抛出未检查异常。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J1/index.html:0
msgid "The certificate can only carry what this record holds, so product, date, lot and dose number are required."
msgstr "证书只能承载这条记录中已有的内容，因此产品、日期、批号和剂次编号都是必填项。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "The child acts through his parents from birth to the clinic abroad; the same rule decides who registers him, who holds his record and who may share it."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j3-made-official/index.html:0
msgid "The child is on Country B's schedule"
msgstr "儿童已纳入 B 国的接种计划"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-1-full-history-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The child is treated with the full record"
msgstr "依据完整记录为孩子诊治"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/how/ohs-fhir-sdk/index.html:0
msgid "The CHW phone, clinic tablet and family wallet are all built on the same open building block, so data is FHIR from the first tap. No conversion step, no vendor lock-in."
msgstr "CHW 手机、诊所平板电脑和家庭钱包都基于同一个开放构建模块，因此数据从第一次点击起就是 FHIR。无需转换步骤，也没有供应商锁定。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j3-made-official/index.html:0
msgid "The clinic checks the signature from Taifafeki against WHO’s trust list, stored locally. One check turns a foreign paper card into trusted clinical data, with no call to Taifafeki."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j3-made-official/index.html:0
msgid "The clinic confirms the cards are genuine"
msgstr "诊所确认卡片为真"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/demo/S8/index.html:0
msgid "The clinic sees nothing, and Onesa sees the attempt: ask who should be told, and when"
msgstr "诊所什么也看不到，而奥内萨能看到这次尝试：请讨论应当告知谁，以及何时告知"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "The cost of not doing it"
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-1-full-history-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The cost of not doing it once"
msgstr "不一次建设到位的代价"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/technical-track/index.html:0
msgid "The cover and Sheets 1 to 6 each table fills in, one country per table. Also: Word (A3) (https://worldhealthorganization.github.io/smart-trust-demo/country-canvas-a3.docx); PDF (https://worldhealthorganization.github.io/smart-trust-demo/country-canvas-a3.pdf)."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The CWT claim set SHALL use the integer keys 1 (iss), 6 (iat), 4 (exp) and -260 (hcert). The hcert map SHALL use integer subclaim keys. The quoted keys in the documentation (\"1\", \"-260\", \"-6\") are JSON notation only and SHALL NOT be emitted as text keys."
msgstr "CWT 声明集应使用整数键 1（iss）、6（iat）、4（exp）和 -260（hcert）。hcert 映射应使用整数子声明键。文档中带引号的键（\"1\"、\"-260\"、\"-6\"）仅为 JSON 表示法，不应作为文本键输出。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J1/index.html:0
msgid "The DAK assets this moment uses: its data sets, the decision tables that decide it, the indicators that measure it"
msgstr "此时刻使用的 DAK 资产：其数据集、作出决策的决策表，以及衡量它的指标"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J4.1/index.html:0
msgid "The data stays home, so the access log does too: the family can see who looked, from where and when."
msgstr "数据留在本国，访问日志也一样：家人可以看到谁、从哪里、在何时查看了记录。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j2-found-at-home/index.html:0
msgid "The decoder SHALL reject characters outside the 45-character alphabet, a dangling single character, and triplets or pairs whose value overflows (above 65535, or above 255 for a trailing pair)."
msgstr "解码器应拒绝 45 字符字母表之外的字符、末尾悬空的单个字符，以及数值溢出的三元组或二元组（超过 65535，或末尾二元组超过 255）。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j3-made-official/index.html:0
msgid "The DID documents are already loaded"
msgstr "DID 文档已加载"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J1/index.html:0
msgid "The doses still happened, but no proof travels. Clinicians in Onesa must re-vaccinate or rely on memory."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j2-found-at-home/index.html:0
msgid "The doses, read but not checked, go into the registration"
msgstr "已读取但未核查的剂次进入登记"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "The driver that dominates"
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The DVCMin model SHALL allow id and dt to be absent and SHALL support gn (parent or guardian) for subjects such as newborns."
msgstr "DVCMin 模型应允许 id 和 dt 缺省，并应支持 gn（父母或监护人），以适用于新生儿等主体。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "The eight steps, their timers and DISCUSS prompts, the use-case cards and the readiness rows are adapted from DPI-H Lab, created by Umer Nisar (CSIRO), in collaboration with Rumanusina Maua (SPC) and Jordi Piera Jimenez, under CC BY 4.0 (creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0). Changes: more than one use case may be ticked, the use case starts from the journeys, the journeys’ questions and tables are woven into the steps, steps 3 to 8 are written for this workshop, and step 7 (Modules × journey) is added. DPI-H Lab is informed by the WHO/ITU DPI-H Reference Architecture, Draft V1.0, and is not produced or endorsed by WHO or ITU. <0>DPI-H Lab<1/></0>"
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/demo/S1/index.html:0
msgid "The family leaves with two paper cards: no app, no account, no network needed to carry them home"
msgstr "家人带着两张纸质卡片离开：无需应用、无需账户，也无需网络就能把它们带回家"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-0-one-family-one-phone/index.html:0
msgid "The family plans a trip to Taifafeki. Bounmy's phone holds the family wallet, with a profile for each of them. Somsak's summary (<0/>) shows six doses: two from Taifafeki, four from Onesa."
msgstr "这家人计划去泰法费基旅行。Bounmy 的手机上装有家庭钱包，其中每人都有一个档案。Somsak 的摘要（<0/>）显示六剂次：两剂来自泰法费基，四剂来自奥内萨。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-family-records-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The family's records go on one shared phone as Verifiable Health Links (J4.0), and a year later a doctor back in Taifafeki reads the whole history from Onesa (J4.1). One chapter of the walkthrough, two BPMN processes, so two sub-journeys."
msgstr "这家人的记录以可验证健康链接的形式存放在一部共享手机上（J4.0），一年后，回到泰法费基的一位医生从奥内萨读取完整的接种史（J4.1）。演练中的一章，两个 BPMN 流程，因此分为两个子旅程。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/personas/khamla-sengmany/index.html:0
msgid "The family's records live on her husband's phone"
msgstr "家庭的记录存放在她丈夫的手机上"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/how/audit/index.html:0
msgid "The family's shared phone"
msgstr "全家共用的手机"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/demo/S5/index.html:0
msgid "The foreign code is kept as issued; the national code is added beside it, never in its place"
msgstr "外国代码按签发原样保留；国家代码添加在其旁边，绝不取而代之"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J2b/index.html:0
msgid "The form is configuration, not code; keeping the answers lets every extracted record trace back to what was asked."
msgstr "表单是配置，而不是代码；保留答案可以让每一条提取出的记录都能追溯到当时所提的问题。"

