msgstr "同一旅程以 WHO SMART 指南 DAK 和 FHIR IG 的形式记录：人物画像、业务流程（BPMN）、要求，以及此处展示的每个载荷都作为已发布的 FHIR 示例。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
msgid "The same ratings as each moment’s gap strip in the walkthrough. The gap report is in the summary."
msgstr "与演练中每个时刻差距栏的评级相同。差距报告见总结。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/discuss/index.html:0
